@startuml rvdroid_llm_guided_testing
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam useBetaStyle true

title RVDroid LLM-Guided Testing Process

|Context Preparation|
start
:Check LLM consultation criteria;
if (Consultation needed?) then (no)
  stop
endif

:Create base context from UI state;
note right: XML hierarchy, text, elements

:Add screenshot description (if enabled);
:Add current exploration status;
:Add memory system insights;
:Add testing goals and progress;
:Add historical actions and results;
:Add available UI elements;
:Add monitored method status;

|Prompt Generation|
:Format context as structured prompt;
:Add system instructions;
:Add format requirements;
:Add response examples;
:Optimize for token usage;

|LLM Consultation|
:Select LLM model based on complexity;
:Send prompt to LLM service;
:Apply resource constraints;
:Wait for response;

|Response Processing|
:Parse LLM response;
:Extract structured data;
:Validate response format;
if (Valid response?) then (yes)
  :Process valid response;
else (no)
  :Apply fallback strategy;
  :Use simplified prompt;
  :Retry or continue without LLM;
endif

|Directive Extraction|
:Extract action directives;
note right: Specific actions to take

:Extract strategy directives;
note right: Strategy adjustments

:Extract exploration directives;
note right: Areas to focus/avoid

|Directive Application|
:Convert action directives to UI actions;
:Find matching UI elements;
:Prioritize directive actions;
:Apply strategy directives to balancer;
:Update exploration parameters;
:Track directive effectiveness;

|Memory Update|
:Update LLM guidance memory;
:Store effective patterns;
:Track guidance success/failure;
:Update consultation frequency;

stop

@enduml